---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Loft Conversion Cambridge | Truleum Loft Specialist"
  description="Loft Conversion Cambridge experts for dormer, Velux and bespoke loft builds. Trusted Cambridge team, clear quotes, quality finishes."
  ogImage="/wp-content/uploads/Loft-Conversion/loft-conversion-cambridge.webp"
>

<style>
  :root {
    --truleum-blue: #0a1a4a;
    --truleum-blue-light: #1a2f75;
    --truleum-gold: #d4af37;
    --truleum-gold-soft: #ffe6a5;
    --text-main: #1f2937;
    --surface: #f7f8fc;
    --white: #ffffff;
  }

  .loft-service-page {
    font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif;
    color: var(--text-main);
    background: var(--white);
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  .lc-wrap {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .lc-hero {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 10% 20%, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.28) 0%, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0) 42%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, #081538 0%, #0a1a4a 45%, #1a2f75 100%);
    padding: 110px 0 90px;
    color: #fff;
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .lc-hero::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto 0 0;
    height: 72px;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(255, 255, 255, 1), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0));
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .lc-hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 42px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .lc-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.7px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--truleum-blue);
    background: var(--truleum-gold-soft);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .lc-hero h1 {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 56px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: -0.6px;
    max-width: 16ch;
  }

  .lc-hero p {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.78;
    max-width: 58ch;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .lc-hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .lc-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    font-size: 15px;
    transition: 0.25s ease;
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }

  .lc-btn-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe89f 0%, #a97d2a 100%);
    color: #101010;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.35);
  }

  .lc-btn-secondary {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    color: #fff;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  }

  .lc-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .lc-metrics {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .lc-metric {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 16px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .lc-metric strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--truleum-gold-soft);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .lc-metric span {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
  }

  .lc-hero-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 18px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(9px);
  }

  .lc-hero-card img {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 14px;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .lc-price {
    margin-top: 14px;
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    color: var(--truleum-blue);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .lc-price strong {
    color: #111827;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .lc-section {
    padding: 84px 0;
  }

  .lc-section h2,
  .lc-section h3 {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }

  .lc-section p {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }

  .lc-heading {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto 36px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .lc-heading h2 {
    color: var(--truleum-blue);
    font-size: clamp(29px, 4vw, 44px);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .lc-heading p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .lc-types {
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .lc-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .lc-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e4e7ef;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 22px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
    transition: 0.25s ease;
  }

  .lc-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1);
  }

  .lc-card i {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 54px;
    height: 54px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: var(--truleum-gold);
    background: rgba(10, 26, 74, 0.08);
    font-size: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .lc-card h3 {
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--truleum-blue);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .lc-card p {
    color: #4b5563;
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .lc-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .lc-card li {
    color: #334155;
    font-size: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .lc-card li i {
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    background: transparent;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--truleum-gold);
  }

  .lc-process-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .lc-step {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 20px 16px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    min-height: 175px;
  }

  .lc-step b {
    display: inline-flex;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--truleum-blue);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .lc-step h3 {
    color: var(--truleum-blue);
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .lc-step p {
    color: #475569;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .lc-why {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a1a4a 0%, #101f4c 100%);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .lc-why .lc-heading h2 {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .lc-why .lc-heading p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }

  .lc-why-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .lc-why-item {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 22px;
  }

  .lc-why-item i {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--truleum-gold-soft);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .lc-why-item h3 {
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .lc-why-item p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .lc-faq {
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .lc-faq-list {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .lc-faq-item {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid #e6e8ef;
    padding: 18px 20px;
  }

  .lc-faq-item h3 {
    color: var(--truleum-blue);
    font-size: 19px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .lc-faq-item p {
    color: #374151;
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .lc-cta {
    padding: 84px 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a1a4a 0%, #193373 100%);
    text-align: center;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .lc-cta h2 {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 46px);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .lc-cta p {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 26px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .lc-breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #64748b;
    margin: 18px auto 0;
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
  }

  .lc-breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--truleum-blue);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .lc-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .lc-process-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .lc-why-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .lc-hero {
      padding-top: 88px;
    }

    .lc-hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .lc-hero h1 {
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .lc-metrics {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .lc-section,
    .lc-cta {
      padding: 62px 0;
    }

    .lc-grid,
    .lc-process-grid,
    .lc-why-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .lc-card,
    .lc-step,
    .lc-why-item,
    .lc-faq-item {
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .lc-heading p,
    .lc-hero p,
    .lc-cta p {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much does a loft conversion Cambridge project usually cost?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A typical loft conversion Cambridge project ranges from around £30,000 to £65,000 depending on design type, structural work, and finishes. A detailed site survey gives the most accurate figure."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do I need planning permission for a Cambridge loft conversion?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Many Cambridge loft conversion projects can be completed under permitted development, but properties in conservation areas or with major roof changes may require planning consent."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How long does a loft conversion take in Cambridge?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Most loft conversion Cambridge projects take 6 to 10 weeks once work begins, depending on complexity, weather, and specification."
      }
    }
  ]
}
</script>

<main class="main-content loft-service-page">
  <section class="lc-hero">
    <div class="lc-wrap lc-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="lc-badge"><i class="fas fa-house-chimney"></i> Cambridge Loft Specialists</span>
        <h1>Loft Conversion Cambridge Designed Around Your Home</h1>
        <p>
          Looking for a premium <strong>Loft conversion Cambridge</strong> service? We design and build practical, beautiful loft spaces that feel like a natural extension of your property. From concept drawings to final finishes, our team delivers each <strong>Cambridge loft conversion</strong> with attention to detail and clear communication. For local area details, visit our <a href="/loft-conversion-cambridge/">Cambridge area page</a>.
        </p>
        <div class="lc-hero-cta">
          <a href="/contact/" class="lc-btn lc-btn-primary">Get a Free Quote <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
          <a href="/gallery/?category=loft-conversion" class="lc-btn lc-btn-secondary">See Loft Projects</a>
        </div>
        <div class="lc-metrics">
          <div class="lc-metric"><strong><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i></strong><span>Free Site Survey</span></div>
          <div class="lc-metric"><strong><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></strong><span>Fully Insured</span></div>
          <div class="lc-metric"><strong><i class="fas fa-award"></i></strong><span>Quality Assured</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lc-hero-card">
        <img src="/wp-content/uploads/Loft-Conversion/loft-conversion-cambridge.webp" alt="Loft Conversion Cambridge project by Truleum">
        <div class="lc-price">
          <span>Typical project investment</span>
          <strong>From £30,000</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lc-section lc-types">
    <div class="lc-wrap">
      <div class="lc-heading">
        <h2>Cambridge Loft Conversion Options</h2>
        <p>
          Every home in Cambridge is different. We help you choose the right loft conversion type based on roof structure, planning constraints, and the living space you need.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lc-grid">
        <article class="lc-card">
          <i class="fas fa-house"></i>
          <h3>Dormer Loft Conversion</h3>
          <p>One of the most popular choices for a loft conversion Cambridge homeowners request, ideal for creating full-height bedrooms and ensuites.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Maximises floor area</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Great for family homes</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Excellent long-term value</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="lc-card">
          <i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i>
          <h3>Velux Loft Conversion</h3>
          <p>A lower-impact Cambridge loft conversion solution using roof windows, ideal when you want natural light and a faster build program.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Cost-efficient option</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Minimal external change</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Faster project timeline</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="lc-card">
          <i class="fas fa-ruler-combined"></i>
          <h3>Hip-to-Gable Conversion</h3>
          <p>Perfect for end-of-terrace and semi-detached properties that need more width and headroom in the new loft area.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Increases usable loft volume</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Works well with dormers</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Strong return on investment</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lc-section">
    <div class="lc-wrap">
      <div class="lc-heading">
        <h2>Our Loft Conversion Process in Cambridge</h2>
        <p>
          We run each project through a proven delivery system so your loft conversion in Cambridge remains organised, transparent, and on schedule.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lc-process-grid">
        <article class="lc-step">
          <b>1</b>
          <h3>Home Survey</h3>
          <p>We assess structure, roof geometry, and access to shape the right scope.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-step">
          <b>2</b>
          <h3>Design Stage</h3>
          <p>Plans are created around how you want to use your new loft room.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-step">
          <b>3</b>
          <h3>Planning Support</h3>
          <p>We guide you through permitted development or planning applications, using current policy from the <a href="https://www.planningportal.co.uk/permission/common-projects/loft-conversion" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">Planning Portal loft conversion guidance</a>.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-step">
          <b>4</b>
          <h3>Construction</h3>
          <p>Structural works, insulation, windows, electrics and first-fix installation.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-step">
          <b>5</b>
          <h3>Final Finish</h3>
          <p>Plastering, joinery, decoration and handover with quality checks complete.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lc-section lc-why">
    <div class="lc-wrap">
      <div class="lc-heading">
        <h2>Why Homeowners Choose Truleum</h2>
        <p>
          If you are comparing companies for a <strong>Cambridge loft conversion</strong>, we combine local expertise, quality craftsmanship, and practical project management from start to finish.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lc-why-grid">
        <article class="lc-why-item">
          <i class="fas fa-location-dot"></i>
          <h3>Local Knowledge</h3>
          <p>We understand Cambridge housing stock, local planning context, and common structural conditions.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-why-item">
          <i class="fas fa-file-signature"></i>
          <h3>Clear Quotations</h3>
          <p>Detailed pricing and scope breakdown, so you know exactly what is included in your build.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-why-item">
          <i class="fas fa-user-shield"></i>
          <h3>Fully Managed</h3>
          <p>Single team handling design coordination, build delivery, and communication throughout.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-why-item">
          <i class="fas fa-star"></i>
          <h3>High-End Finish</h3>
          <p>Strong attention to detail on layout, light, storage and final finishing quality.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lc-section lc-faq">
    <div class="lc-wrap">
      <div class="lc-heading">
        <h2>Loft Conversion Cambridge FAQs</h2>
        <p>
          Quick answers to the most common questions we receive from homeowners planning a Cambridge loft conversion.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lc-faq-list">
        <article class="lc-faq-item">
          <h3>How much does a loft conversion Cambridge project usually cost?</h3>
          <p>Most projects fall between £30,000 and £65,000, depending on loft type, structural requirements, and specification level.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="lc-faq-item">
          <h3>Do I need planning permission for a Cambridge loft conversion?</h3>
          <p>Many projects fit permitted development rules, but some properties may need full permission. We advise this early during survey and design. We also align every project with <a href="https://www.gov.uk/building-regulations-approval" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">UK building regulations requirements</a>.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="lc-faq-item">
          <h3>How long does a loft conversion take?</h3>
          <p>A standard loft conversion in Cambridge typically takes 6 to 10 weeks once site works begin, subject to complexity.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lc-cta">
    <div class="lc-wrap">
      <p style="margin-bottom:14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);">Helpful resources: <a href="/loft-conversion-glossary/" style="color:#ffe89f; font-weight:600;">Loft Conversion Glossary</a> | <a href="/loft-conversion-cost-cambridge/" style="color:#ffe89f; font-weight:600;">Cambridge Cost Guide</a> | <a href="/loft-conversion-cambridge-guide/" style="color:#ffe89f; font-weight:600;">Planning Guide</a></p>
      <h2>Ready to Start Your Loft Conversion in Cambridge?</h2>
      <p>
        Speak to our team for practical advice, tailored design options, and a no-obligation quote for your property. Let's create a loft space that adds daily comfort and long-term value.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="lc-btn lc-btn-primary">Book Your Free Consultation <i class="fas fa-calendar-check"></i></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<!-- Mobile safety styles (retained from source) -->
<style>
  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    main, main * {
      visibility: visible !important;
      opacity: 1 !important;
    }
  }
</style>

</BaseLayout>
